# text = Poor little girl , she was very low-spirited ; and when I told her that my London expedition had failed , she fairly broke down , and burst in to a storm of sobs and lamentations , telling me that I ought not to have married her if I could give her nothing but poverty and misery ; and that I had done her a cruel wrong in making her my wife .
