# text = Do you suppose I would let you go alone I was sure you would go with me Does your friend send any address No ; but she always lived at Crescent Villa , West Brompton ; and no doubt she lives there still Robert , please will you marry me Figtree Court is not gay in the long vacation but I think , upon the whole , it's better than this ; at any rate , it's near a tobacconist's I shall be glad to get back , Bob for I want to take a run down to Southampton ; I haven't seen the little one for upward of a month the little one I'm not a romantic man , Bob and I never read a line of poetry in my life that was any more to me than so many words and so much jingle ; but a feeling has come over me , since my wife's death , that I am like a man standing upon a long , low shore , with hideous cliffs frowning down upon him from behind , and the rising tide crawling slowly but surely about his feet .
