# text = Shall we try the secret passage , George Yes , if you wish it Now listen to me You must let yourself down by the hands into the passage , which is about four feet high ; stoop your head , walk straight along it till you come to a sharp turn which will take you to the left , and at the extreme end of it you will find a short ladder below a trap-door like this , which you will have to unbolt ; that door opens into the flooring of my lady's dressing-room , which is only covered with a square Persian carpet that you can easily manage to raise .
