# text = A scrap of paper , a shred of some torn garment , the button off a coat , a word dropped incautiously from the overcautious lips of guilt , the fragment of a letter , the shutting or opening of a door , a shadow on a window-blind , the accuracy of a moment tested by one of Benson's watches -- a thousand circumstances so slight as to be forgotten by the criminal , but links of iron in the wonderful chain forged by the science of the detective officer ; and lo ! the gallows is built up ; the solemn bell tolls through the dismal gray of the early morning , the drop creaks under the guilty feet , and the penalty of crime is paid
