# text = The idea of my thinking of George's sister what a preposterous idiot I am From Clara Talboys Yes , from Clara Talboys , most decidedly ; I recognized a feminine resemblance to poor George's hand ; neater than his , and more decided than his , but very like , very like I wonder what she says to me It's a long letter , I dare say ; she's the kind of woman who would write a long letter -- a letter that will urge me on , drive me forward , wrench me out of myself , I've no doubt .
