# text = I couldn't send a letter by post , not knowin ' where to direct to , and I couldn't give it into your own hands , and I'd been told partickler not to let anybody else know of it ; so I'd nothing to do but to wait and see if you come back , and bide my time for givin ' of it to you . " I thought I'd go over to the Court in the evenin'and see Phoebe , and find out from her when there'd be a chance of seein ' her lady , for I know'd she could manage it if she liked .
