# text = Shall we go together , my dear love , and bring our brother back between us There's lots of letters , yer honor and there's some parcels , and there's a gentleman which has called ever so many times , and is waitin ' to-night , for I towld him you'd written to me to say your rooms were to be aired God knows that from the moment in which I sunk into the black pit , knowing the treacherous hand that had sent me to what might have been my death , my chief thought was of the safety of the woman who had betrayed me .
